Description: |
  Host-side CLI wrapper cell for the single pipeline command. Both discovery
  mode (no name) and run mode (name provided) launch the goga Docker container
  and invoke the in-container pipeline entrypoint inside it. The runtime
  boundary to the pipeline cell is docker — this cell has no Python Type
  Imports from it. Run mode mounts a persistent afm state host directory so
  afm state survives across runs of the same pipeline in the same project on
  the same branch; the --clean flag wipes this directory before launch.
